#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:71
#, xml-text
msgid "Links Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependências do &quot;Links&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:73
#, xml-text
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Recomendadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid "<xref linkend=\"libevent\"/>"
msgstr "<xref linkend=\"libevent\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Graphics mode requires at least one of <xref linkend=\"gpm\"/> (mouse "
"support to be used with a framebuffer-based console), <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.svgalib.org/\">SVGAlib</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pkgs.fedoraproject.org/repo/pkgs/directfb/\"> "
"DirectFB</ulink>, and <xref linkend=\"x-window-system\"/>"
msgstr ""
"O modo gráfico exige pelo menos um de <xref linkend=\"gpm\"/> (suporte de "
"mouse para ser usado com um console baseado em framebuffer), <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.svgalib.org/\">SVGAlib</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pkgs.fedoraproject.org/repo/pkgs/directfb/\">DirectFB</ulink> "
"e <xref linkend=\"x-window-system\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For decoding various image formats <application>Links</application> can "
"utilize <xref linkend=\"libavif\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpng\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libjpeg\"/>, <xref linkend=\"librsvg\"/>, and <xref "
"linkend=\"libtiff\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Para decodificar vários formatos de imagem, o "
"<application>Links</application> consegue utilizar <xref "
"linkend=\"libavif\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libpng\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libjpeg\"/>, <xref linkend=\"librsvg\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"libtiff\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:100
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For decompressing web pages that are compressed with Brotli, "
"<application>Links</application> can utilize <xref linkend=\"brotli\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Para descomprimir páginas da &quot;web&quot; que estejam comprimidas com o "
"&quot;Brotli&quot;, o &quot;<application>Links</application>&quot; consegue "
"utilizar o &quot;<xref linkend=\"brotli\"/>&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Links"
msgstr "Instalação do Links"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "First, fix an issue introduced by glibc-2.43 and higher:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, corrija um problema introduzido pela glibc-2.43 e superiores:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed '/*strchr/s/cast_const_char //g' -i ftp.c</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed '/*strchr/s/cast_const_char //g' -i ftp.c</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Links</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Links</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --mandir=/usr/share/man &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --mandir=/usr/share/man &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:132
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m755 /usr/share/doc/links-&links-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/links_cal/* KEYS BRAILLE_HOWTO \\\n"
"    /usr/share/doc/links-&links-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -d -m755 /usr/share/doc/links-&links-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/links_cal/* KEYS BRAILLE_HOWTO \\\n"
"   /usr/share/doc/links-&links-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/textweb/links.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-graphics</option>: This switch enables support for graphics"
" mode."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-graphics</option>: Essa chave habilita o suporte para modo "
"gráfico."

